%A Portero-Tresserra M., Gracia-Rubio I., Cantacorps L., Pozo O. J., Gómez-Gómez A., Pastor A., López-Arnau R., de la Torre R., Valverde O.
%K AnimalsBinge Drinking/etiology/*metabolismBiogenic Monoamines/metabolismConditioning Psychological/drug effects/physiologyCorpus Striatum/drug effects/*metabolismEndocannabinoids/*metabolismMale*Maternal DeprivationMice Inbred C57BLPrefrontal Cortex/drug effects/*metabolismRandom AllocationRewardSocial BehaviorSpatial Behavior/drug effects/physiologyStress Psychological/metabolismAdolescenceAlcoholEndocannabinoidsMaternal separationMonoaminesStriatum
%K Mice
%K Alcohol Drinking
%K Alcoholics
%K Prefrontal Cortex
