%A Monte A. S., Mello B. S. F., Borella V. C. M., da Silva Araujo T., da Silva F. E. R., Sousa F. C. F., de Oliveira A. C. P., Gama C. S., Seeman M. V., Vasconcelos S. M. M., Lucena D. F., Macêdo D.
%K AnimalsBrain/drug effects/metabolismDisease Models AnimalFemaleLipid Peroxidation/drug effectsMaleMemory Disorders/chemically inducedMemory Short-Term/drug effects/physiology*Oxidative Stress/drug effectsPoly I-C/pharmacologyPrepulse Inhibition/drug effects/physiology*Schizophrenia/chemically inducedSex CharacteristicsNeonatal poly(I:C)Oxidative imbalanceSchizophreniaSex differencesTwo-hit animal model
