%K 14-3-3 Proteins/metabolismAnimalsAntidepressive Agents/*pharmacology/therapeutic useCOP9 Signalosome Complex/metabolismCathepsin D/metabolismDepression/*drug therapy/metabolism/pathologyDisease Models AnimalDynamins/metabolismElectron Transport Complex III/metabolismFemaleFluoxetine/*pharmacology/therapeutic useHippocampus/*cytologyImipramine/*pharmacology/therapeutic useImmobility Response Tonic/drug effectsMaleMitochondria/*drug effects/metabolismPregnancyPrenatal Exposure Delayed EffectsProtein Deglycase DJ-1/metabolismProteome/*drug effectsProteomicsRatsStathmin/metabolismStress PsychologicalFluoxetineHippocampusImipramineMitochondriaPrenatal stress
