%A Balázsfi D., Farkas L., Csikota P., Fodor A., Zsebők S., Haller J., Zelena D.
%K Amino Acid Transport Systems Acidic/genetics/*metabolismAnimalsAnimals NewbornAnxiety/*metabolismCorticosterone/metabolismFemaleGlutamic Acid/metabolismHypothalamo-Hypophyseal System/*metabolismMale*Maternal DeprivationMiceMice KnockoutNeurons/metabolismPituitary-Adrenal System/*metabolismVocalization AnimalAdrenocorticotropincorticosteronelipopolysaccharidepupultrasonic vocalization
%K Glutamic Acid
