%K Proteins/genetics/metabolismMaleMembrane Proteins/genetics/metabolismPregnancyPrenatal Exposure Delayed Effects/*physiopathologyRatsReceptors Glutamate/genetics/*metabolism*Sex CharacteristicsStress Psychological/*complicationsSwimming/psychologydepressionglutamate receptorsprenatal stresssex difference
