%A Ehrlich D. E., Neigh G. N., Bourke C. H., Nemeth C. L., Hazra R., Ryan S. J., Rowson S., Jairam N., Sholar C. A., Rainnie D. G., Stowe Z. N., Owens M. J.
%K Amygdala/drug effects/growth & development/*physiopathologyAnimalsAnxiety/etiology/*physiopathologyCitalopram/*pharmacologyCorticosterone/bloodDisease Models AnimalEstradiol/bloodFemaleGene Expression/drug effectsMemory Disorders/etiology/physiopathologyPregnancy*Prenatal Exposure Delayed EffectsRats Sprague-DawleyReceptor Serotonin 5-HT1A/metabolismSelective Serotonin Reuptake Inhibitors/*pharmacologySolute Carrier Family 12 Member 2/metabolismStress Psychological/drug therapy/*physiopathologySymporters/metabolismgamma-Aminobutyric Acid/metabolismK Cl- CotransportersAntidepressantAnxietyGabaPrenatal stressSerotoninservices. The terms of this arrangement have been reviewed
