%T Sodium butyrate functions as an antidepressant and improves cognition with enhanced neurotrophic expression in models of maternal deprivation and chronic mild stress
%D 2014
%8 2014
%J Curr Neurovasc Res
%V 11
%N 4
%P 359-66
%A Valvassori S. S., Varela R. B., Arent C. O., Dal-Pont G. C., Bobsin T. S., Budni J., Reus G. Z., Quevedo J.
%K Analysis of VarianceAnimalsAntidepressive Agents/*therapeutic useButyric Acid/*therapeutic useCognition Disorders/*drug therapy/etiologyDepression/*drug therapy/*etiologyDisease Models AnimalExploratory Behavior/drug effectsGene Expression Regulation/drug effectsHippocampus/drug effects/metabolismIntercellular Signaling Peptides
