%T Prenatal stress produces social behavior deficits and alters the number of oxytocin and vasopressin neurons in adult rats
%D 2013
%8 2013
%J Neurochem Res
%V 38
%N 7
%P 1479-89
%A de Souza M. A., Centenaro L. A., Menegotto P. R., Henriques T. P., Bonini J., Achaval M., Lucion A. B.
