%K Eating Disorders/drug therapy/metabolismFemaleFluoxetine/*pharmacology/therapeutic useHippocampus/drug effects/*metabolismHypothalamus/drug effects/metabolism*Maternal DeprivationRaphe Nuclei/drug effects/*metabolismRatsSerotonergic Neurons/*drug effects/metabolismSerotonin/metabolismSerotonin Plasma Membrane Transport Proteins/biosynthesisSelective Serotonin Reuptake Inhibitors/*pharmacology/therapeutic use
