%T Maternal deprivation effects on brain plasticity and recognition memory in adolescent male and female rats
%D 2013
%8 2013
%J Neuropharmacology
%V 68
%P 223-31
%A Marco E. M., Valero M., de la Serna O., Aisa B., Borcel E., Ramirez M. J., Viveros M. P.
%K AnimalsBehavior Animal/physiologyBrain/metabolism/*physiopathologyFemaleGlial Fibrillary Acidic Protein/metabolismMale*Maternal DeprivationMaze Learning/physiologyNeural Cell Adhesion Molecules/metabolismNeuronal Plasticity/*physiologyRatsRats WistarReceptor Cannabinoid CB1/metabolismReceptor Cannabinoid CB2/metabolismRecognition Psychology/*physiologyStress Psychological/metabolism/*physiopathology
%K Brain
