%A Leussis M. P., Freund N., Brenhouse H. C., Thompson B. S., Andersen S. L.
%K AnimalsBehavior Animal/*physiologyDepression/*metabolismFemaleFrontal Lobe/*metabolismHelplessness LearnedMale*Maternal DeprivationParvalbumins/metabolismRatsRats Sprague-Dawley*Sex Characteristicsgamma-Aminobutyric Acid/*metabolism
%K Sex Characteristics
