%A Hikichi H., Murai T., Okuda S., Maehara S., Satow A., Ise S., Nishino M., Suzuki G., Takehana H., Hata M., Ohta H.
%K Allosteric Regulation/drug effects/physiologyAnimalsBehavior Animal/drug effects/physiologyCentral Nervous System/*drug effects/physiologyCognitionElectric CountershockExcitatory Amino Acid Antagonists/chemistry/*pharmacology/therapeutic useFeverLocomotionMaleMaze LearningMiceMice Inbred ICRPentylenetetrazolePyridones/chemistry/*pharmacology/therapeutic useRatsRats Sprague-DawleyReceptors Metabotropic Glutamate/*antagonists & inhibitors/metabolismRodentia/physiologyUltrasonicsVocalization Animal
%K Pyridines
