%T Pharmacological effects of the metabotropic glutamate receptor 1 antagonist compared with those of the metabotropic glutamate receptor 5 antagonist and metabotropic glutamate receptor 2/3 agonist in rodents: detailed investigations with a selective allosteric metabotropic glutamate receptor 1 antagonist FTIDC [4-[1-(2-fluoropyridine-3-yl)-5-methyl-1H-123-triazol-4-yl]-N-isopropyl-N-methyl-36-dihydropyridine-1(2H)-carboxamide]
%D 2008
%8 2008
%J J Pharmacol Exp Ther
%V 326
%N 2
