%T Sinisan alleviates depression-like behaviors by regulating mitochondrial function and synaptic plasticity in maternal separation rats
%D 2022
%8 2022
%J Phytomedicine
%V 106
%P 154395
%A Deng D., Cui Y., Gan S., Xie Z., Cui S., Cao K., Wang S., Shi G., Yang L., Bai S., Shi Y., Liu Z., Zhao J., Zhang R.
