%K Amygdala/drug effects/embryology/physiologyAnimalsDisease Models AnimalFemaleHumansHypothalamus/drug effects/embryology/physiologyOxytocin/*pharmacologyPregnancyPregnancy Complications/psychologyPrenatal Exposure Delayed EffectsRatsSchizophrenic Psychology*Social BehaviorStress Physiological/*embryology/prevention & control/psychology
%K Rats
