%T Opposite effects of maternal separation on intermale and maternal aggression in C57BL/6 mice: link to hypothalamic vasopressin and oxytocin immunoreactivity
%D 2007
%8 2007
%J Psychoneuroendocrinology
%V 32
%N 5
