%D 2022
%8 2022
%J ACS Chem Neurosci
%V 13
%N 13
%P 1948-1965
%A Dandekar M. P., Palepu M. S. K., Satti S., Jaiswal Y., Singh A. A., Dash S. P., Gajula S. N. R., Sonti R.
%K AnimalsAnxiety/metabolismBehavior AnimalBrain/metabolismDepression/metabolismDisease Models AnimalFemale*Gastrointestinal MicrobiomeGlutamine/metabolismHippocampus/metabolismHumansMaleMaternal DeprivationPhenotype*Probiotics/pharmacologyRatsRats Sprague-DawleyStress Psychological/metabolismSucroseBdnfCrpCumsdepressiongut microbiome−brain axismaternal separationprobiotic
