%A Sampedro-Viana D., Cañete T., Sanna F., Soley B., Giorgi O., Corda M. G., Torrecilla P., Oliveras I., Tapias-Espinosa C., Río-Álamos C., Sánchez-González A., Tobeña A., Fernández-Teruel A.
%K cagecameraanimal experimentanimal modelantisocial behavioranxietyarticlecontrolled studyhabituationmalenegative syndromeneonatal handlingnewbornnonhumannovel object recognition testphenotypepsychiatric treatmentpsychosocial withdrawalratrat strainRoman high avoidance ratRoman low avoidance ratschizophreniaself groomingsocial interactionsocial interaction teststrain differencesymptomatology
