%A Tsotsokou G., Nikolakopoulou M., Kouvelas E. D., Mitsacos A.
%K Bio-SpinEthovision XTimaging softwaremedical devicevideo tracking systembeta actinmetabotropic receptor 5adultanimal experimentanxietyarticlebehaviorchemiluminescence immunoassaychromatographyDNA methylationearly life stresselevated plus maze testfemalegene expressionhippocampusimmunoblottingimmunodetectionmalematernal deprivationmedial prefrontal cortexmental diseasemRNA expression levelnewbornnonhumanopen field testpolyacrylamide gel electrophoresisprotein analysisprotein expression levelratrodent modeltranscription initiationventral hippocampusImageJ
%K Infant, Newborn
