%T CRTC1 signaling involvement in depression-like behavior of prenatally stressed offspring rat
%D 2021
%8 2021
%J Behavioural Brain Research
%V 399
%A Si Y., Xue X., Liu S., Feng C., Zhang H., Zhang S., Ren Y., Ma H., Dong Y., Li H., Xie L., Zhu Z.
