%K Drive 2LCModel 3-1Bpreclinical MRI scannerSPSS 13.04 aminobutyric acidchloral hydrateglutamic acidglutaminen acetylaspartic acidadultamino acid metabolismanimal experimentanimal modelarticlebrain sizecognitive defectcontrolled studydata analysis softwaredepressionearly life stressfemalehippocampusmalematernal deprivationMorris water maze testnonhumanopen field testprefrontal cortexpriority journalproton nuclear magnetic resonanceratspatial memorysucrose preference testsugar intake
