%T Maternal separation plus social isolation during adolescence reprogram brain dopamine and endocannabinoid systems and facilitate alcohol intake in rats
%D 2020
%8 2020
%J Brain Research Bulletin
%V 164
%P 21-28
%A Amancio-Belmont O., Becerril Meléndez A. L., Ruiz-Contreras A. E., Méndez-Díaz M., Prospéro-García O.
%K alcoholcannabinoidcannabinoid 1 receptorcannabinoid 2 receptordopaminedopamine 2 receptordopamine 3 receptorendocannabinoidadolescenceadolescentadultalcohol consumptionanimal behavioranimal experimentanxietyarticlechild parent relationcontrolled studydopamine brain leveldrinking behaviorearly life stressfemalein vivo studymalematernal deprivationnonhumannucleus accumbenspersonal experiencepriority journalprotein expressionratsocial isolation
%K Rats
