%T Effects of BDNF Signaling on Anxiety-Related Behavior and Spatial Memory of Adolescent Rats in Different Length of Maternal Separation
%D 2020
%8 2020
%J Frontiers in Psychiatry
%V 11
%A Zhang X., Li H., Sun H., Jiang Y., Wang A., Kong Y., Sun X., Zhu G., Li Q., Du Z., Sun H., Sun L.
%K brain derived neurotrophic factorcorticosteroneadolescentanimal experimentanimal modelanimal tissueanxiety disorderarticlebiochemical analysisbody weight lossbrain developmentbrain functioncognitive developmentcontrolled studycorrelational studycorticosterone blood leveldescriptive researchdisease severitylocomotionmalematernal deprivationnewbornnonhumanopen field testperinatal periodphenotypeprefrontal cortexprogenyprolonged maternal separationprotein blood levelprotein expressionratrat modelsignal transductionspatial learningspatial memorySprague Dawley ratY-maze test
%K Adolescent
%K Rats
%K Brain-Derived Neurotrophic Factor
