%T Glutamic acid decarboxylase 67 haplodeficiency in mice: consequences of postweaning social isolation on behavior and changes in brain neurochemical systems
%D 2020
%8 2020
%J Brain Structure and Function
%V 225
%N 6
%P 1719-1742
%A Nullmeier S., Elmers C., D’Hanis W., Sandhu K. V. K., Stork O., Yanagawa Y., Panther P., Schwegler H.
%K 4 aminobutyric acidcholine acetyltransferasedopamineglutamate decarboxylase 67serotonintyrosine 3 monooxygenaseaggressionamygdalaanimal cellanimal experimentanimal modelanimal tissueanxietyarticlebasal forebrainbrain histologycatecholaminergic systemcell densitycholinergic nervecholinergic systemcontrolled studydentate gyrusdepressiondopaminergic systemdorsal hippocampusearly life stresselevated plus maze testforced swim testGABAergic systemhippocampal CA1 regionimmobilityimmunohistochemistrylocomotionmalemental diseasemesencephalonmotor coordinationmousenerve fiberneurochemistryneurotransmissionnonhumanopen field testprepulse inhibitionpriority journalraphe nucleusrotarod testschizophreniasensory gatingseptal areaserotoninergic systemsocial behaviorsocial dominancesocial interactionsocial interaction testsocial isolationsocial stressstartle reflexsubstantia nigraventral tegmentum
%K Glutamate Decarboxylase
%K Glutamic Acid
%K Brain
