%A de Souza J. A., da Silva M. C., Costa F. C. O., de Matos R. J. B., de Farias Campina R. C., do Amaral Almeida L. C., da Silva A. A. M., Cavalcante T. C. F., Tavares G. A., de Souza S. L.
%K fluoxetineglyceraldehyde 3 phosphate dehydrogenaseserotoninserotonin 1B receptorserotonin 2C receptorserotonin transporteradultanimal experimentanticipationarticlecircadian rhythmcontrolled studyearly life stresseatingfeeding behaviorfemalefood intakegene expressiongroominghypothalamuslactationmalematernal deprivationmeal sizenonhumanpriority journalprogenyprotein expressionratRNA geneserotoninergic system
