%A O'Mahony S. M., McVey Neufeld K. A., Waworuntu R. V., Pusceddu M. M., Manurung S., Murphy K., Strain C., Laguna M. C., Peterson V. L., Stanton C., Berg B. M., Dinan T. G., Cryan J. F.
%K galactose oligosaccharideglucosemilk fatmilk fat globule membranepolydextroseprebiotic agentunclassified druganimal experimentanimal tissuearticlecognitioncontrolled studydiet supplementationearly life stressfat intakefemalegenetic transcriptionintestine floralearningmalematernal deprivationnervous system functionnonhumanperinatal periodprefrontal cortexpriority journalprogenyratspatial memoryphysiological stressstress reactivityvisceral sensitivity
%K Brain
