%P 5365-5380
%A Trojan E., Chamera K., Bryniarska N., Kotarska K., Leśkiewicz M., Regulska M., Basta-Kaim A.
%K adultanimal experimentanimal modelantidepressant activityantiinflammatory activityarticlebehavior disorderchronic drug administrationcontrolled studyenzyme activityfrontal cortexgene expressionhippocampusinflammationlong term caremalenonhumanprenatal stressprogenyprotein expressionratsignal transductionupregulationanxiolytic agentchemokine receptor CCR2cryopyrinendogenous compoundfluoxetineinducible nitric oxide synthaseinflammasomeinterleukin 18interleukin 1betainterleukin 1beta converting enzymemonocyte chemotactic protein 1tianeptinetoll like receptor 4venlafaxine
%K Brain
