%P 179-192
%A Rincel M., Aubert P., Chevalier J., Grohard P. A., Basso L., Monchaux de Oliveira C., Helbling J. C., Lévy É, Chevalier G., Leboyer M., Eberl G., Layé S., Capuron L., Vergnolle N., Neunlist M., Boudin H., Lepage P., Darnaudéry M.
%K kruppel like factor 2lipopolysaccharidetranscription factor FosBadultAlloprevotellaanimal experimentanimal modelanxietyArc genearticlebacteriumBacteroidesBtg2 geneC3H/He mousechronic unpredictable stresscompulsiondysbiosisearly life stressEgr4 geneelevated plus maze testemotionfemaleFosb genegenegene expressionimmunoreactivityintestine floraKlf2 geneLachnospiraceaeLactobacillusmalemarble burying testmaternal deprivationmedial prefrontal cortexmouseMucispirillumnonhumanpopulation abundancePorphyromonadaceaepriority journalsex differencesocial behaviorsocial interactionspecies composition
%K Brain
