%J Experimental Neurobiology
%V 28
%N 3
%P 337-351
%A Lee Y., Han P. L.
%K 78 dihydroxyflavonebrain derived neurotrophic factorbrain derived neurotrophic factor receptorcyclic AMP responsive element binding proteindopamine 2 receptormitogen activated protein kinase 1mitogen activated protein kinase 3small interfering RNAadultanimal experimentanimal modelanimal tissuearticleautismbehavior changecompulsioncontrolled studydorsal striatumdown regulationearly life stressfemalegene knockoutgroomingheterozygotemalematernal deprivationmousenonhumanpathogenesisprotein expressionsignal transductionsocial disabilitysocial interactionsocial interaction teststereotypytissue level
