%K brain derived neurotrophic factorbrain proteinDNA methyltransferase 3Ahistonelysinemethyl CpG binding protein 2repressor element 1 silencing transcription factorten eleven translocation proteintranscription factorunclassified drugadolescentadultadulthoodamygdalaanimal experimentarticlecontrolled studyearly life stressepigeneticsfemalehistone acetylationhistone methylationmothernonhumanpersonal experiencepriority journalratRattus norvegicussocial behaviorsocial interactionstressful social experience
