%T Prenatal stress disrupts social behavior cortical neurobiology and commensal microbes in adult male offspring
%D 2019
%8 2019
%J Behavioural Brain Research
%V 359
%P 886-894
%A Gur T. L., Palkar A. V., Rajasekera T., Allen J., Niraula A., Godbout J., Bailey M. T.
