%A Czarzasta K., Makowska-Zubrycka M., Kasarello K., Skital V. M., Tyszkowska K., Matusik K., Jesion A., Wojciechowska M., Segiet A., Wrzesien R., Biały M., Krzascik P., Wisłowska-Stanek A., Sajdel-Sulkowska E. M.
%K antidepressant agentapelinbiological markerbrain derived neurotrophic factorcorticosteronecyclophilinglucocorticoid receptorglyceraldehyde 3 phosphate dehydrogenasemessenger RNAmineralocorticoid receptoranimal experimentanimal modelanxietyarticlecardiovascular diseasecardiovascular malformationcerebellumchronic stresscomorbiditycontrolled studycorticosterone blood levelechocardiographyelevated plus maze testfemalegestation periodgroomingheartheart developmentheart functionhippocampusmaternal stressmaternal welfarenerve cell differentiationnonhumanperinatal depressionpostnatal depressionpregnancypriority journalpuerperiumratreal time polymerase chain reactionsocial interactionsocial stress
