%A Ershov N. I., Bondar N. P., Lepeshko A. A., Reshetnikov V. V., Ryabushkina J. A., Merkulova T. I.
%K histone H3messenger RNAadultanimal experimentanimal tissueanxietyarticlechromatin immunoprecipitationchromatin structurecontrolled studyDNA damage induced apoptosis suppressor geneearly life stressexploratory behaviorgenegene expression regulationgenomicshistone methylationmalematernal deprivationmousenonhumanopen field testphosphatidylinositol 5 phosphate 4 kinase type II alpha genepolymerase chain reactionprefrontal cortexpromoter regionRNA processing
%K Mice
