%J Journal of Neuroinflammation
%V 14
%N 1
%A Zhu Y., Wang Y., Yao R., Hao T., Cao J., Huang H., Wang L., Wu Y.
%K glucocorticoid receptorimmunoglobulin enhancer binding proteininterleukin 1betainterleukin 6pyrrolidine dithiocarbamatesevofluranetrichostatin Atumor necrosis factoradultanimal experimentanimal modelanimal tissuearticleastrocytebehavior changecognitive defectcontrolled studycytokine releaseDNA methylationearly life stressexonfear conditioning testfemalegeneral anesthesiahippocampusintracellular signalingmalematernal deprivationMorris water maze testnervous system inflammationnewbornnonhumanpromoter regionrat
%K DNA (Cytosine-5-)-Methyltransferase
%K Receptors, Glucocorticoid
