%A Herbeck Y. E., Amelkina O. A., Konoshenko M. Y., Shikhevich S. G., Gulevich R. G., Kozhemyakina R. V., Plyusnina I. Z., Oskina I. N.
%K corticosteronecorticotropin releasing factorglucocorticoid receptormessenger RNAadultaggressivenessanimal experimentarticlecontrolled studycorticosterone blood levelexperiencefeedback systemfemalehippocampushumanhypothalamic tissuehypothalamuslight-dark testmalematernal behaviormaternal carenonhumanpriority journalratRattus norvegicusphysiological stress
%K Humanities
