%A Jaimes-Hoy L., Gutiérrez-Mariscal M., Vargas Y., Pérez-Maldonado A., Romero F., Sánchez-Jaramillo E., Charli J. L., Joseph-Bravo P.
%K corticosteroneenzymefenfluramineliothyronineprotirelinprotirelin degrading enzymethyrotropinunclassified drugadultanimal experimentanimal modelanxietyarticlebody weightbrown adipose tissueclinical evaluationcontrolled studycorticosterone blood leveldiet restrictionelevated plus maze testenergy balanceenzyme degradationfemalegene expressionhypothalamic paraventricular nucleushypothalamushypothalamus hypophysis thyroid systemjuvenile animallocomotionmalematernal deprivationnewbornnonhumanopen field testperinatal periodpriority journalprotein expressionratsex differencestarvationtanycytethyrotropin blood levelbody weight gainwhite adipose tissue
