%T Fragmentation and high entropy of neonatal experience predict adolescent emotional outcome
%D 2016
%8 2016
%J Translational Psychiatry
%V 6
%A Molet J., Heins K., Zhuo X., Mei Y. T., Regev L., Baram T. Z., Stern H.
%K dopaminesucroseadolescentadolescent behavioranhedoniaanimal experimentanxietyarticlebiological rhythmbrain developmentbrain maturationclinical assessmentcontrolled studydepressiondopaminergic activityearly life stressemotional disorderentropyenvironmental factorhelplessnesshumanmalematernal behaviormaternal caremathematical analysisnewbornnewborn periodnonhumancare behavioroutcome assessmentpeer grouppersonal experiencepleasureprogenyratrearingsensory cortexsensory stimulationsocial interaction
