%A Murgatroyd C. A., Hicks-Nelson A., Fink A., Beamer G., Gurel K., Elnady F., Pittet F., Nephew B. C.
%K gamma interferonoxytocintumor necrosis factorvasopressinadultaggressionanimal experimentanimal modelanxiety disorderarticlechronic stresscontrolled studydam (animal)depressiondrug mechanismenzyme linked immunosorbent assayfemalegroominglactationlocomotionmalemarble burying testmaternal behaviornonhumanopen field testprogenyratsocial behaviorsocial interactionsocial stress
%K Vasopressins
