%V 6
%N 5
%A Cowan C. S. M., Callaghan B. L., Richardson R.
%K drinking waterprobiotic agentadultamnesiaanimal experimentanimal modelarticlebehavior changedigestive system function disorderearly life stressfearfluid intakefollow upinfantLactobacillus helveticusLactobacillus rhamnosuslearningmaternal deprivationmemorymental healthnonhumanratseparation anxiety
%K Probiotics
