%A Llorente-Berzal A., Manzanedo C., Daza-Losada M., Valero M., López-Gallardo M., Aguilar M. A., Rodríguez-Arias M., Miñarro J., Viveros M. P.
%K midomafetamine5 hydroxyindoleacetic acidcannabinoid 1 receptorcorticosteroneendocannabinoidleptinserotoninadolescentanimal experimentarticlebrain cortexcontrolled studycorpus striatumfemalehippocampusmalematernal deprivationneurochemistrynewbornnonhumanopen field testplace preferenceprenatal exposurepriority journalprotein expressionpsychobiologyratrewardserotoninergic systemsex difference
%K Adolescent
