%A Lomanowska A. M., Ammari N., Kraemer G. W.
%K alpha adrenergic receptoramphetamineprazosinanimal behavioranimal experimentanimal housingarticlecontrolled studydrug mechanismdrug responsedrug sensitivityearly life stressenvironmental enrichmentlocomotionmalematernal deprivationneurotransmissionnonhumannoradrenergic systempriority journalratrearingsocial behaviorsocial environmentsocial interactionsocial isolationweaning
%K Motor Activity
