%P 333-344
%A Zimmerberg B., Foote H. E., Van Kempen T. A.
%K brain derived neurotrophic factoranimalarticlecomparative studyconditioned reflexenzyme linked immunosorbent assayfemalehippocampuslearningLong Evans ratmalematernal deprivationmental stressmetabolismmilkodorolfactory bulbpsychological aspectratsex differencesuckling animaltime
%K Brain
