%K AnimalsAnti-Anxiety Agents/*pharmacology/therapeutic useAntidepressive Agents/*pharmacology/therapeutic useAnxiety/*drug therapy/etiology*AutophagyBeclin-1/metabolismDepression/*drug therapy/etiologyDisks Large Homolog 4 Protein/metabolismFemaleGlutamic Acid/metabolismHippocampus/drug effects/metabolismMaleMaternal DeprivationPhloroglucinol/*analogs & derivatives/pharmacology/therapeutic useRatsRats WistarReceptor Notch1/metabolismReceptors N-Methyl-D-Aspartate/metabolismSynaptophysin/metabolismTerpenes/*pharmacology/therapeutic useAnxietyAutophagyDepressionHyperforinNotch1 receptor
