%T Pathways involved in gut mucosal barrier dysfunction induced in adult rats by maternal deprivation: Corticotrophin-releasing factor and nerve growth factor interplay
%D 2007
%8 2007
%J Journal of Physiology
%V 580
%N 1
%P 347-356
%A Barreau F., Cartier C., Leveque M., Ferrier L., Moriez R., Laroute V., Rosztoczy A., Fioramonti J., Bueno L.
