%P 83-90
%A Marin M. T., Planeta C. S.
%K cocainecorticosteroneadolescentanimal experimentarticlebehaviorblood samplingcontrolled studycorticosterone blood levelfemalelocomotionmalematernal deprivationnonhumanperinatal periodpriority journalradioimmunoassayratphysiological stresstrunk
