%P 463-468
%A Zinimerberg B.
%K brexanolone4 aminobutyric acid receptoralcoholsteroidanimal experimentarticlebehaviorconditioningcontrolled studyfemaleintracerebroventricular drug administrationlearninglearning disordernewbornnonhumanodorprenatal exposurepriority journalratphysiological stresstask performanceultrasonic vocalizationultrasoundvocalization
%K Infant, Newborn
